{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-dispatch","title":"多重分派","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/raku-language/types-dispatch/multi-dispatch","wordCount":1279,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"多重分派\">多重分派</h1><p>很多语言有「重载」：你可以给同名函数写几个版本，由参数的静态类型在编译期决定调哪个。Raku 的多重分派（multiple dispatch）更进一步——它在运行期、根据实参的实际类型与数量，从所有候选体里挑出「最贴合」的那一个。这一字之差（编译期静态类型 vs 运行期实际类型）让多分派从「语法便利」升级为「派发引擎」，是 Raku 把 <a href=\"gradual-typing\">渐进类型</a> 的类型信息真正用起来的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多重分派是 Raku 把类型信息真正用起来的地方——它在运行期按实参的实际类型与数量择优，而非编译期按静态类型重载：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>multi</code> 挂多候选</strong>：同名子例程或方法组成候选集合，调用时按类型与元数选出唯一最匹配者。</li>\n<li><strong>窄度排序</strong>：候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 窄，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟦</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟧</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟦</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟧</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\llbracket T_A \\rrbracket \\subseteq \\llbracket T_B \\rrbracket</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span>；子类比父类窄，带 <code>where</code>、<code>:D</code> 的更窄。</li>\n<li><strong>执行流程</strong>：绑定过滤 → 窄度排序 → 取唯一最窄；并列报 <code>Ambiguous call</code>、无人匹配报 <code>No applicable candidate</code>，逼你显式消歧。</li>\n<li><strong><code>proto</code> 与 <code>nextsame</code>/<code>callsame</code></strong>：统一门面签名，并让候选像责任链一样从窄到宽串联。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"multi-给一个名字挂多个候选\">multi：给一个名字挂多个候选</h2><p>用 <code>multi</code> 关键字声明的同名子例程或方法，会组成一个候选集合。调用时 Raku 遍历所有候选，绑定实参，选出唯一最匹配者：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"raku\" data-code=\"multi greet(Str $name)          { &quot;你好，$name&quot; }&#10;multi greet(Int $age)           { &quot;你今年 $age 岁&quot; }&#10;multi greet(Str $name, Int $age) { &quot;$name，$age 岁&quot; }&#10;multi greet()                   { &quot;你好，陌生人&quot; }&#10;&#10;say greet(&quot;阿May&quot;);      # 你好，阿May      —— 匹配 (Str)&#10;say greet(30);           # 你今年 30 岁     —— 匹配 (Int)&#10;say greet(&quot;阿May&quot;, 30);  # 阿May，30 岁     —— 匹配 (Str, Int)&#10;say greet();             # 你好，陌生人     —— 匹配空签名\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>multi greet(Str $name)          { \"你好，$name\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi greet(Int $age)           { \"你今年 $age 岁\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi greet(Str $name, Int $age) { \"$name，$age 岁\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi greet()                   { \"你好，陌生人\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>say greet(\"阿May\");      # 你好，阿May      —— 匹配 (Str)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>say greet(30);           # 你今年 30 岁     —— 匹配 (Int)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>say greet(\"阿May\", 30);  # 阿May，30 岁     —— 匹配 (Str, Int)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>say greet();             # 你好，陌生人     —— 匹配空签名</span></span></code></pre></div><p>候选可以按类型不同、也可以按参数个数（元数 arity）不同。这天然取代了别处常见的「一个函数里塞一堆 if/类型判断」的写法，把分支逻辑拆成结构清晰、可独立扩展的候选体——而且第三方可以在不改原函数的前提下，给同名函数新增候选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"窄度排序-谁才是-最匹配\">窄度排序：谁才是「最匹配」</h2><p>当多个候选都能接受同一组实参时，Raku 要在它们之间排序，选最「窄」（最具体）的那个。窄度的核心规则可以这样理解：候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 比候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 窄，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 接受的实参集合是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的子集。形式化地，记类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 能接受的值集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟦</mo><mi>T</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟧</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\llbracket T \\rrbracket</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则在参数位置上</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>≺</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟦</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟧</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟦</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟧</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\prec B \\iff \\llbracket T_A \\rrbracket \\subseteq \\llbracket T_B \\rrbracket</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说子类比父类窄、带 <code>where</code> 约束的比不带的窄、定义性 <code>:D</code> 比不限定的窄。下面这组候选演示了排序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"raku\" data-code=\"multi f(Any $x) { &quot;any: $x&quot; }&#10;multi f(Numeric $x) { &quot;numeric: $x&quot; }&#10;multi f(Int $x) { &quot;int: $x&quot; }&#10;multi f(Int $x where * &gt; 100) { &quot;big int: $x&quot; }&#10;&#10;say f(5);        # int: 5         —— Int 比 Numeric/Any 窄&#10;say f(3.14);     # numeric: 3.14  —— 不是 Int，落到 Numeric&#10;say f(500);      # big int: 500   —— where 约束最窄，胜出&#10;say f(&quot;hi&quot;);     # any: hi        —— 只有 Any 接受\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>multi f(Any $x) { \"any: $x\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi f(Numeric $x) { \"numeric: $x\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi f(Int $x) { \"int: $x\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi f(Int $x where * > 100) { \"big int: $x\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>say f(5);        # int: 5         —— Int 比 Numeric/Any 窄</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>say f(3.14);     # numeric: 3.14  —— 不是 Int，落到 Numeric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>say f(500);      # big int: 500   —— where 约束最窄，胜出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>say f(\"hi\");     # any: hi        —— 只有 Any 接受</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>候选签名</th>\n<th>接受集合</th>\n<th>相对窄度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>(Any $x)</code></td>\n<td>所有值</td>\n<td>最宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(Numeric $x)</code></td>\n<td>所有数值</td>\n<td>较窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(Int $x)</code></td>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>更窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>(Int $x where * &gt; 100)</code></td>\n<td>大于 100 的整数</td>\n<td>最窄</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当两个候选互不为子集（窄度无法比较）又都匹配时，Raku 抛出 <code>Ambiguous call</code> 错误，逼你显式消歧——这比悄悄选一个、留下隐蔽 bug 要好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分派的执行流程\">分派的执行流程</h2><p>把上面的规则连起来，一次多分派调用的完整流程是：收集候选 → 过滤出能绑定实参的 → 按窄度排序 → 取唯一最窄者；若并列则报歧义，若无人匹配则报 <code>No applicable candidate</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[调用 f 实参] --&gt; B[收集所有 multi 候选]&#10;    B --&gt; C{逐个尝试绑定}&#10;    C --&gt;|能绑定| D[加入候选池]&#10;    C --&gt;|不能绑定| E[丢弃]&#10;    D --&gt; F{候选池有几个}&#10;    F --&gt;|0 个| G[报错 No applicable candidate]&#10;    F --&gt;|1 个| H[直接调用]&#10;    F --&gt;|多个| I[按窄度排序]&#10;    I --&gt; J{有唯一最窄吗}&#10;    J --&gt;|有| H&#10;    J --&gt;|并列| K[报错 Ambiguous call]\">flowchart TD\n    A[调用 f 实参] --&gt; B[收集所有 multi 候选]\n    B --&gt; C{逐个尝试绑定}\n    C --&gt;|能绑定| D[加入候选池]\n    C --&gt;|不能绑定| E[丢弃]\n    D --&gt; F{候选池有几个}\n    F --&gt;|0 个| G[报错 No applicable candidate]\n    F --&gt;|1 个| H[直接调用]\n    F --&gt;|多个| I[按窄度排序]\n    I --&gt; J{有唯一最窄吗}\n    J --&gt;|有| H\n    J --&gt;|并列| K[报错 Ambiguous call]</pre><h2 id=\"proto-与-nextsame-约束与串联候选\">proto 与 nextsame：约束与串联候选</h2><p><code>proto</code> 给整个候选集声明一个公共「门面」签名，既能统一返回类型，又能在分派前后插入公共逻辑；<code>{*}</code> 标记「在此处真正派发到具体候选」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"raku\" data-code=\"proto process(|) {*}                      # | 表示接受任意签名&#10;multi process(Str $s) { &quot;字符串：$s&quot; }&#10;multi process(Int $n) { &quot;整数：$n&quot; }&#10;&#10;# callsame / nextsame：在候选内部把控制权交给「次窄」的候选&#10;multi log-it(Str $msg) {&#10;    say &quot;[字符串日志] $msg&quot;;&#10;    nextsame;                # 继续派发到更宽的候选&#10;}&#10;multi log-it(Any $msg) {&#10;    say &quot;[通用日志] $msg.gist()&quot;;&#10;}&#10;log-it(&quot;启动&quot;);&#10;# [字符串日志] 启动&#10;# [通用日志] 启动\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>proto process(|) {*}                      # | 表示接受任意签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi process(Str $s) { \"字符串：$s\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi process(Int $n) { \"整数：$n\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># callsame / nextsame：在候选内部把控制权交给「次窄」的候选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi log-it(Str $msg) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    say \"[字符串日志] $msg\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    nextsame;                # 继续派发到更宽的候选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>multi log-it(Any $msg) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    say \"[通用日志] $msg.gist()\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>log-it(\"启动\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># [字符串日志] 启动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># [通用日志] 启动</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>nextsame</code>/<code>callsame</code> 让候选体可以像责任链一样串联——窄候选处理完自己关心的部分，再把活儿交给更宽的候选。这与 <a href=\"roles-classes\">角色与类</a> 里方法解析的 <code>callsame</code> 同源，本质都是沿「窄到宽」的解析序移动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与重载-模式匹配的关系\">与重载、模式匹配的关系</h2><p>多分派常被拿来和两样东西比。一是 C++/Java 的重载：那是编译期按静态类型选，多态对象会选错版本；Raku 是运行期按实际类型选，永远选对。二是函数式语言的模式匹配（如 Haskell、Rust 的 <code>match</code>）：模式匹配在一个函数体内按值的结构分支，多分派则把分支拆成独立、可被外部扩展的候选。两者各有所长——Raku 也有 <code>given/when</code> 做体内分支，但跨类型的派发更推荐用 multi。模式匹配的函数式视角见 <a href=\"../../functional-programming/algebraic-types/pattern-matching\">模式匹配</a>，元编程层面「按类型选代码」的普遍意义见 <a href=\"../../metaprogramming/metaprogramming-foundations/what-is-metaprogramming\">元编程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>multi</code> 让一个名字挂多个候选，按实参的实际类型与数量在运行期择优——是运行期分派，不是编译期重载。</li>\n<li>窄度排序：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>≺</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\prec B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟦</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟧</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟦</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">⟧</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\llbracket T_A\\rrbracket \\subseteq \\llbracket T_B\\rrbracket</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1778em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span>；子类、<code>where</code>、<code>:D</code> 都让候选更窄。</li>\n<li>流程是「绑定过滤 → 窄度排序 → 取唯一最窄」；并列报歧义、无人匹配报错，逼你显式消歧。</li>\n<li><code>proto</code> 统一门面签名，<code>nextsame</code>/<code>callsame</code> 让候选像责任链一样从窄到宽串联。</li>\n<li>相比重载更精准（实际类型）、相比体内模式匹配更可扩展（候选可被外部新增）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：候选签名上的类型来自 <a href=\"gradual-typing\">渐进类型</a>；方法层面的解析序见 <a href=\"roles-classes\">角色与类</a>。</li>\n<li>本 hub：签名绑定建立在 <a href=\"../foundations/sigils-containers\">Sigil 与容器</a> 的容器模型上。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：函数式的 <a href=\"../../functional-programming/algebraic-types/pattern-matching\">模式匹配</a> 与多分派互为镜像；多态的类型学视角见 <a href=\"../../type-systems/inference-and-polymorphism/polymorphism\">多态</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://docs.raku.org/language/functions#Multi-dispatch\">Raku 文档：多重分派</a>、<a href=\"https://www.kdnuggets.com/the-raku-programming-language-theres-more-than-one-way-to-do-it\">KDnuggets: There&#39;s More Than One Way To Do It</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多重分派","id":"多重分派"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"multi：给一个名字挂多个候选","id":"multi-给一个名字挂多个候选"},{"level":2,"text":"窄度排序：谁才是「最匹配」","id":"窄度排序-谁才是-最匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"分派的执行流程","id":"分派的执行流程"},{"level":2,"text":"proto 与 nextsame：约束与串联候选","id":"proto-与-nextsame-约束与串联候选"},{"level":2,"text":"与重载、模式匹配的关系","id":"与重载-模式匹配的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"渐进类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/raku-language/types-dispatch/gradual-typing"},"next":{"title":"角色与类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/raku-language/types-dispatch/roles-classes"}}